  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔐 Auth",
      "description": "Authentication & profile routes mounted at `/api/auth` (see `server/src/routes/auth.route.js`).\n\n| Method | Route | Protected |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| POST | `/api/auth/signup` | ❌ |\n| POST | `/api/auth/login` | ❌ |\n| POST | `/api/auth/logout` | ✅ |\n| GET | `/api/auth/check` | ✅ |\n| PUT | `/api/auth/fullname` | ✅ |\n| PUT | `/api/auth/update-profile` | ✅ |",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Signup",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 201\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Response contains token and user\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(res).to.have.property(\"token\");",
                  "    pm.expect(res).to.have.property(\"user\");",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// Auto-save token + user id for the rest of the collection",
                  "if (res.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", res.token);",
                  "    console.log(\"✅ JWT saved to collection variable 'token'\");",
                  "}",
                  "if (res.user && res.user._id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"myUserId\", res.user._id);",
                  "    console.log(\"✅ myUserId saved:\", res.user._id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"fullName\": \"Test User\",\n  \"email\": \"testuser@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"123456\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/signup",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "signup"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Create a new user account.\n\n**Body (all required):**\n| Field | Type | Rule |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `fullName` | string | required |\n| `email` | string | required, must be unique |\n| `password` | string | required, min 6 characters |\n\nOn success the server hashes the password (bcrypt, 10 rounds), creates the user, and returns a **JWT (7d)**. The test script stores it in `{{token}}`."
          },
